(
  'IELTS vs TOEFL for US admission: which test is easier?',
  'Get practical help with ielts vs toefl for us admission: which test is easier?. This IELTS guide explains the key choices, common mistakes, and focused…',
  'Explore ielts vs toefl for us admission: which test is easier? with a practical IELTS guide covering key decisions, useful preparation, and focused…',
